window.products.push({"id":658004,"name":"Bosch MUM6N11UC Universal Plus Stand Mixer, 800 Watt, 6.5-Quarts with 6 Cup Blender","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UEXmzbA8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Bosch Universal reputation of quality began in 1952. Known for performance and exceptional reliability, Bosch takes food preparation to a whole new level. The Bosch kitchen mixer is uniquely designed with its motor out of the way, making it more compact and lightweight. Dual wire whips spin independently as they rotate, creating triple whipping action and allowing you to whip as little as one egg white into over a cup of meringue. Wire whips aerate light or pourable mixtures and batters, mash cooked potatoes, or shred hot, cooked meats in seconds.The heavy-duty dough hook mimics the motions of hand kneading to stretch, tuck, and fold the dough for maximum gluten development, kneading 100% of the dough every 4 rotations. With the included dough hook extender, you can knead as little as one loaf of bread (3 cups flour) or up to 14 1-pound loaves, with either white or whole grain flour. The powerful belt-driven transmission delivers adequate torque to knead light or heavy loads without overheating or bogging down. The dough hook can also mix up to 34 dozen cookies in a single batch.Four suction feet on the base grip the mixer to your counter and provide optimum stability. Choose from 4 speeds with pulse. Convenient cord storage. 6.5-quart bowl locks in place and has a removable drive shaft for easy cleaning. Bowl, lid, pouring shield, and wire whips are dishwasher safe; dough hook is hand-wash only.The included blender fits on the direct drive to the 800 watt motor, has a large 6 cup capacity and is made of sturdy Lexan material. Dual stainless steel blades are designed to pull the food down into a vortex to easily pulverize, mix, and blend. Many optional accessories and attachments are available to purchase for increased functionality, such as a meat grinder, citrus juicer, cookie paddles, cake paddles, bowl scraper, food processor, slicer/shredder, pasta maker, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UEXmzbA8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSCH","source_asin":"B00938S1V0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00938S1V0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00938S1V0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":658005,"name":"Portable Evaporative Cooler, LifePlus Bladeless Cooling Tower Fan with Instant Cool & Independent Humidifier, Remote Control, 50° Oscillation, Low Noi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612nbYkz65L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆【Independent Humidifier】 This evaporative cooler fan has a self-contained mist humidifier on top that produces a cool mist of water vapor for quick cooling when turned on. When the room temperature drops, the air cooler fan continues to work, and the independent sprinklers can be turned off individually. ❆【Bladeless Safe Design】This room air cooler adopts a bladeless design, which is safer than ordinary fans. Unlike other fans that need to spin on their own for a wiggling effect, this room cooler for bedroom changes the wind direction by turning the blades counter-clockwise or clockwise. This functional design is not only more advanced but also more secure! ❆【Convenient Bottom Pulley】With four handy pulleys on the bottom of this portable air cooler for room, we can easily move it anywhere when its tank is full. The pulley design allows us to carry it easily even by one person! ❆【LED Digital Display】This portable evaporative cooler has an LCD digital display in the middle, which not only shows the specific temperature of the room, but also displays icons for all functions. With the icons displayed on this display you can clearly know which function is being activated. ❆【5L Large Water Tank & 4 Ice Boxes】The water tank of this bladeless tower fan has a capacity of about 5L, which is about 1.32 gallons. At the same time, we will give you 4 ice boxes of equal size. You can replace them in pairs. ❆【Remind】We promise a one-year warranty for this evaporative air cooler fan. If this cooler fan cannot be used due to quality problems within one year, we will re-issue a new product for you or give you a full refund!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612nbYkz65L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B09MTGZC55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MTGZC55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MTGZC55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
