window.products.push({"id":658240,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer with Auto-Off Timer, Coffee Warmer for Desk with Auto ON/OFF, Waterproof Coffee Cup Warmer with 3-Temp Settings, Mug Warmer with Dig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dTugRVWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coffee Cup Warmer with Auto Shut Off/On Timer: In the heating state, you can choose to automatically shut down the mug warmer after several hours of continuous operation through the timer button. There are 6 choices: 2H, 4H, 6H, 8H, 10H, 12H. If you don't adjust it, the coffee warmer will automatically shut down after 8 hours of continuous work by default. In the off state, you can choose when to turn it on. The selected time will keep flashing. Thoughtful & Warm Gift: length- 5.7”, width- 4.56”, height- 1”, diameter of the heating plate: 3.7”, cord length: 54”. Beautifully packaged the mug warmer for desk is the thoughtful gift to express your love. Durable & Safe: The coffee warmer is more durable and easy to clean due to the water resistance and heat resistance of the material and vents at the bottom of the warmer. This coffee warmer for desk adopts high-efficiency PTC metal panel which has better heating effect and is suitable most cups. In addition, we also have a silicone pad to protect the heating plate. Mug Warmer for Desk with Digital Display: The temperature and timing you have selected will be displayed on the digital display. Don't worry about having to set it up from scratch caused by forgetting your choices. Please note that the cup warmer does not display real-time temperature and time. Mug Warmer with 3-Temp Settings: The coffee mug warmers are available in three temperatures: 131℉, 158℉ and 176℉. After pressing the power button, the coffee cup warmer for desk defaults to the temperature 131℉. You can choose the right temperature according to your needs to keep your beverages hot or warm. Say goodbye to lukewarm beverage with this coffee cup warmer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dTugRVWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YANXUS","source_asin":"B0BF9DTQ6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF9DTQ6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF9DTQ6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
