window.products.push({"id":658450,"name":"Fruit and Vegetable Washing Machine, USB Wireless Fruit and Vegetable Cleaner Device, Food Purifier for Cleaning Fruits and Vegetables, Rice, Meat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713pm4QXwNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plastic: BPA-Free Plastic 【Wireless and Portable】Built-in 4400mAh high-capacity rechargeable battery, the fruit and vegetable purifier can be used up to 30 times when fully charged. There is no noise during use. Small and portable, Suitable for outdoor travel. 【Long-term use - Efficient purification】 OZcono fruit and vegetable purifier regularly works in water so we use Titanium as a conductive electrode to prevent oxidation and corrosion, this is the difference compared with other machines of stainless steel. OZcono Fruit and Vegetable cleaner machine adopts high-energy ion filtration technology, uses water as raw material, does not add chemicals and does not damage the nutrition of processed foods. 【Easy to Use and Clean】Press the power button and put the fruit and vegetable cleaner into the water, it will be best for 1 press of the button with a capacity of 3-5L for 10 minutes to start the food cleaning process, The water capacity will be equivalent to the number of turns on . The top cover can be removed for deep cleaning after each use. The Fruit and Vegetable Cleaner can be used with tap water, filtered water. 【OH-ion Purification Technology】The Hydroxy Water Ion Purification Technology utilizes water as its raw material. 1: Through the process of electrolysis, water is decomposed into OH- and H+ with the aid of an electrolytic material. 2: OH- is utilized to degrade chemical molecules and cell walls, rendering them harmless. 3: A deep purification process takes place wherein OH- and Cl combine to form HClO, which deeply degrades residues and harmful ingredients. 【Safety and Service】The OZcono capsule food purifier combines safety and convenience to provide a   cleaning device meets IPX7 waterproof standards, ensuring safe and reliable use. You can purchase it with confidence thanks to our 90-day worry-free refund and replacement policy, which provides a risk-free shopping experience. The Seller 10-15 days delivery is fake, DON'T BUY ANYTHING FROM THEM.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713pm4QXwNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OZCONO","source_asin":"B0BNH8KPZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNH8KPZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNH8KPZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
