window.products.push({"id":658502,"name":"Xierdio Stainless Steel Canopy Bed Frame Post, Bedroom Decoration Support is Used for Metal Wooden Bed Platform Bed Queen Size Double Full Double Bed(","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613fZYPDzyL._AC_SL1177_.jpg","description":"Item: Canopy Bed Frame Post Material: Stainless Steel Color: Silver size: Twin Size: L: 2m x W: 1m x H: 1.95m Full Size: L:2m X W:1.35m X H:1.95m Queen Size: L:2m X W:1.5m X H:1.95m King Size: 2.2mX W:1.8m X H:1.95m Package Included:1 set of canopy bed frame post( Not Included the mosquito netting, just frames)  Assembling Instruction Step 1st : Open the box,divide all the parts into 6 parts ,(Metal Tee connecters/width poles/length poles/standing poles/ Presser foot/top intermediate bar).  Step 2nd: Every group assembly the short poles into long poles.Finally,you should have 4pcs standing poles,2pcs width poles,2 long poles ,1 top intermediate rod.  Step 3rd: Install the 4pcs metal tee connecters on the top of each standing poles.  Step 4th: Install the standing poles,then put the foot presse under the feet of your bed.  Step 5th: Install the width poles and the length poles.  Step 6th: Install the top center bar to the top center position.    Installation tips: Most of the overall bracket connections are threaded, except for the three-way connection position, which uses a concave point in-line connection.three-way joints do not grip cross poles.If it is easy to loose and separate,please paste a circle of adhesive tape to the joint of tee and cross bar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613fZYPDzyL._AC_SL1177_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xierdio","source_asin":"B0BNC4YNG2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNC4YNG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNC4YNG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
