window.products.push({"id":658521,"name":"Top Collection Solar The Red Dragon - Mini Collectible Fantasy Figurine (Rocking Out)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813R-aTPpKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MUSIC IS THE FUEL TO SOLAR'S FIRE - Music is what feelings sound like. Solar loves to lose himself in his favorite tunes! MAKE SOMEONE's DAY - You, yes you there with your beautiful smile. This is so cute you couldn't help but smile isn't it? Why don't you pass that smile forward to someone else! These make for an excellent way to tell someone: You're awesome and I know it! THE PERFECT COLLECTIBLE SIZE - Are you running out of space to collect cute things? Don't worry. We thought of you. These are specially designed to be the perfect collectible size, and would be right at home on a display shelf or your desk. This figurine measures H: 2.75\" L: 3.5\" HOW IS IT MADE? Our mission is more smiles per figurine. That's why every single one of our products are designed in-house and sculpted by professional artists with maximum cuteness in mind. The sculpted product then gets cast into a high quality collectible-grade cold cast resin figurine. Each little detail is then carefully painted on by hand. It's pretty neat! PROMISED SATISFACTION - By now, most discerning, good looking, inspired shoppers will have already made the sensible choice. Need more convincing? We have over 2,475 positive ratings - that's 99.5%. Plus our 100% satisfaction promise applies to everything we sell","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813R-aTPpKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Top Collection","source_asin":"B07YGMBZXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YGMBZXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YGMBZXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
