window.products.push({"id":658578,"name":"TuPuCN Digital Alarm Clock LCD Snooze Dual Projection Clock and Clapping Voice Controll with Indoor Temperature and Calendar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313rgRe7KFL._AC_.jpg","description":"100% Brand new and high quality. Projection the time on ceiling. This projection clock is special about its Clapping Controlled Function by which you can gently clap around the product to activate projection of time and LCD backlight. It can also be functioned to rotate 150 degrees of projection, which in turn eases you to view the time when lying in the bed. Also dual alarm time settings are available. No more struggle to see the time when you wake up. With our projection clock, you can have your time as soon as your eyes opened, because the projector on this alarm clock allows you to display the time on your ceiling or wall, so the time will always be in full view when you need it. The swiveling projector can be tilted a full 150 degrees, enabling you to project the time virtually anywhere. The adjustable focus knob allows the time to be projected clearly for easy viewing, and projection can be turned on and off as desired. When the projection is turned off, you can easily view the time on the LED display. Features: Clap your palms gently around the clock or tap the table where the product is placed, or touch any parts of the product, LCD back light and projection light will be on. Project time in large red digits on your walls and ceiling LCD screen display with 8 second EL backlight in easy-to-read numbers Display of time, date, alarm and temperature Dual alarms can be set and used independently. Snooze function with 4 minute interval 200 years calendar memories. 9 language options available for week display. Specifications Power Source: 3x1.5V (AAA-R03) ,NOT INCLUDED USB Cable Dimensions: 18.00*6.00*8.00cm (L*W*H) Color: White","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313rgRe7KFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TuPuCN","source_asin":"B01LPWH1TO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LPWH1TO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LPWH1TO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
