window.products.push({"id":658595,"name":"MOV COMPRA Movcompra Double Layer Insulated Lunch bag for Men Anti Shake Reusable Lunch Bag Meal Prep Lunch Bag With Adjust-shoulder Strap (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m9+KKrUBS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Leakproof & thermal insulated - The outside of the lunch bag is made of water-repellent Oxford cloth, which is durable and strong. The interior is equipped with an environmentally friendly aluminum film, which is easy to clean, even if the sauce is spilled, you can easily wipe it off with a tissue. And it also waterproof. There is 5mm pearl cotton in the middle, which can keep heat and ice for a long time. Easy to carry. Double Deck - L10.27\"*W8.27\"*H3.94\"+6.3\", Up to 14 cans. Two separate insulated compartments allow you to pack hot food and cold food separately for hours until it’s time to eat. You can put lunch or dinner on the lower deck, fruit, and snacks on the upper deck, etc. No worry anymore about what order to place everything in since the hot and cold won't mix anymore. With thick permanent foam interlining and insulated Al film lining to improve the insulation. Muti use & Convenience - Thermal Lunch Box Great for men and women to pack food and drinks for work, school, picnics, beach, road trips, camping, traveling, or any outdoor activities. What's more, the lunch bag has many pockets for storage. One side is 2 mesh pockets for water bottle and umbrella or others. Another side is wide mesh pockets for a napkin. On the front zipper pocket for tableware. On the back zipper pocket for phone, keys or coins, and so on. Anti Shake Design - Even if it is a sealed insulation box, excessive shaking will cause the food inside to deform and break. In the bottom of the Movcompra lunch bag is equipped with elastic fixing buckles, the intersecting elastic bands can protect the lunch box from excessive shaking to the greatest extent. Even if you place a meal box smaller than a meal bag or other packaged food. we can make them better fixed in the meal bag. This solves a lot of trouble when you use it. Perfect Detail - The best cooler lunch box, we focus on every tiny accessory, soft handle strap and a detachable shoulder strap for easily carry. Two compartment easy to access through front opening with a 4-way dual zipper closure. This thermal tote is great for packing large amounts of food, even could contain the whole day food that you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m9+KKrUBS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOV COMPRA","source_asin":"B08R619B3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R619B3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R619B3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
