window.products.push({"id":658765,"name":"SHINESTAR 12 Inch Pizza Peel Set, Includes Metal Pizza Peel with Detachable Handle, Wooden Pizza Peel, Pizza Kits and Tools for Grill, Oven, 6 PCS Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BW6julEDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you getting ready to make pizza like a pro? SHINESTAR 6 piece pizza tools set are must-have! A whole set is enough to make you a master of making pizza.  Features: Extra Tool: The pizza spinner made of anodized aluminum with oaken handle allows you to rotate and inspect your pizza while it's still cooking and pair with pizza peel can help you remove a pizza easier.  Aluminum pizza peel's flat surface is made of anodized aluminum to strictly guarantee your food safety, and a 19.5\" handle enables you to get pizza in and out coolly without the use of extra gloves.  The measurement counter mat is made of premium food-grade silicone, safe, soft, durable, nonstick, easy to clean, and rolls up neatly for storage.  All wooden parts are made of high-quality oak, sturdy, durable, and food safe.  Package: 1 Aluminum Pizza Peel 1 Wooden Pizza Peel 1 Silicone Pastry Mat 1 Pizza Cutter Wheel 1 Pizza Server 1 Pizza Spinner  Note: Be sure to be generous with the cornmeal under your pizza dough so the pizza slides nicely onto the stone. We recommend not to put these tools in the dishwasher, because like other wooden products on the market, over time, the extreme heat of the dishwasher might cause the wood to warp or crack. Please don't use the wooden peel to bake the pizza on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BW6julEDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHINESTAR","source_asin":"B088LNKMMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LNKMMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LNKMMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":658766,"name":"SpineAlign Pillow - Patented & Award Winning - 100% Adjustable Contour Pillow - Promotes Healthy Spine Alignment for Better Sleep - Perfect for Side &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710O6eV4oVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GET PROPER ALIGNMENT FOR BETTER SLEEP - Promote healthy alignment and sleep better with our fully adjustable SpineAlign pillow. Designed and tested by our in-house Chiropractor, The SpineAlign pillow is a proven method of achieving better head and neck alignment for better sleep and support. Winner of 2020 Best Adjustable pillow by Tuck dot com. FULLY ADJUSTABLE FOR A PERFECT FIT - Zippers on the back of the pillow allow you to add or remove a proprietary blend of CertiPUR-US fill to customize to your exact fit. SOFT & BREATHABLE COVER - The outer covering is comprised of a soft polyester fabric with strips of mesh for better breathability and comfort. SAFE & NON-TOXIC - We use toxic-free high quality CertiPur-Certified materials. Rest easy, you're not breathing in any harmful chemicals. DESIGNED BY A SPORTS CHIROPRACTOR - After treating thousands of patients who suffer from poor sleep and insomnia, Dr. Jason Loth D.C. patented this pillow technology to help you get the best sleep possible. THE PILLOW, ELEVATED - Average store bought pillows are just that, average. Unfortunately, they offer little to no support for your head and neck and very few offer any kind of adjustability. It's the first patented fully adjustable and customizable contour pillow. The SpineAlign pillow is expertly designed with human ergonomics in mind for the ultimate in comfort. ADJUSTING YOUR PILLOW - It is very important to give yourself a minimum of 30 days to allow your body to adjust to sleeping correctly on your newSpineAlign pillow. Years of sleeping with poor posture cannot be instantly reversed. The SpineAlign Pillow is not a medical device and is not intended to diagnose, treat, mitigate or cure any disease. Claims for the SpineAlign Pillow are based on medical opinion and actual user experience and not on actual clinical studies. Individual results may vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710O6eV4oVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dr. Loth's SpineAlign Pillow","source_asin":"B07B53DQG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B53DQG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B53DQG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":658767,"name":"Haizhidian Cloth Fabric Shower Curtain, 72\" W x 72\" H Heavy Duty Shower Curtain, No Chemical Odor and Machine Washable, Perfect for Showers & Bathtubs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aQnL+01hL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"DIMENSION - 72\" width x 72\" length, work well for nearly any standard bathtub and shower area. PREMIUM QUALITY - Made from expertly chosen and thoroughly tested polyester fabric, no chemical odor, which is made to withstand moisture-rich bathroom environments. Also ensures the water beads gliding away quickly like a seed pearl in rolling on the lotus leaves. Touches like a cotton feel and wrincle-free. Thick fabric crafted with premium fabric makes it strong, durable and easy to clean. WEIGHTED BUTTOM HEM - Heavy-weight, woven fabric construction prevents the curtain from billowing and Floating, its weighted hem keeps your curtain in place, do not stick to your body. MULTIPURPOSE - Excellent for showers and bathtubs for your home, campers, motels, hotels, dorms and more. Elegant and upscale look easy to update bathroom decor theme. EASY CARE & CONVENIENT - Machine washable with gentle settings or wipes clean with a damp cloth, cool iron if needed and AIR DRY IS RECOMMEND. Fits many standard size shower/tub and works with straight or curved shower rods and change the shower rings/hooks that you like Easily","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aQnL+01hL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAIZHIDIAN","source_asin":"B08BC9CQ2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BC9CQ2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BC9CQ2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
