window.products.push({"id":658863,"name":"Gersemi Cocktail Smoker kit with Torch, 4 Flavored Wood Chips - 2 Rock Glasses Whiskey Stones Drink Accessories to Infuse Cocktails, Whiskey, Bourbon ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hXPmzOo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Greetings from Gersemi. Do your taste buds crave smoke infused flavors? Do you have a crew that appreciates fresh and exciting ways to wet their palate? Let me introduce you to Gersemi's new luxury cocktail smoker set. We will reinvent the way you enjoy cocktails and offer you the opportunity to wow your people. So many flavors At first, we invite you to start off by infusing your drink with just one of the wood chip flavors. Over time and when your palate is ready for more, try combining two or more of the flavored chips and see what other aroma's you can infuse with your beverage. With so many different options of whiskeys, bourbons and cocktails out there, you will never run out combinations to try. What Gersemi has created for you to treasure. 1) Gersemi's beautifully designed smoker that fits any standard rock glass {includes a brush to clean the smoker screen} 2) Stylish and easy to use torch. We didn't want a complicated torch with multiple settings or switches. They are difficult to use especially after a couple of beverages ***Butane is not included.*** 3) Four containers of flavored wood chips: Cherry, Apple, Oak and Walnut 4) Silver leaf spoon to transport wood chips from containers to the smoker 5) Two gold rimmed diamond shaped rock glasses 6) Mini treasure box that houses 4 gold stainless steel whiskey stones and the tongs 7) It all arrives in a fancy wooden box perfect to display in anyone's home bar or dining room Thank you for taking the time to review our product here on Amazon. We hope to earn your business and can't wait to see you again!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hXPmzOo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gersemi LLC","source_asin":"B09ZXNK4YG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZXNK4YG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZXNK4YG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
