window.products.push({"id":658973,"name":"Briarwood Home Jersey Knit Bed Sheet Set 100% Modal, Heavy Weight, T-Shirt Soft, Cozy 3 Piece Bedding Fade & Wrinkle Free, All Season Breathable Sheet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ohaBb23mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modal Imported ✔️ULTRA SOFT AND SILKY TOUCH: 100% Modal Bed Sheet Set. Breathable which provide you maximum sleep comfort. Recognized as a top product by excellent customer reviews. Deep pocket fitted sheet with elastic all around Made with highly extendable modal fibers which adds to the breathability and durability of the sheets, Ultra-stretchy modal jersey sheet set will spread evenly on your mattresses leaving no wrinkles at all. Gives you a warm and coziest feeling like laying on a 5 star Hotel Bedding. ✔️TWIN - 3 Piece Sheet Set Includes: Flat Sheet: 66\" W x 96\" L; Fitted Sheet: 39\" W x 75\" L x 10\" D (fits up to 13\" mattress); Pillow Case: 20\" W x 30\" L, fitted sheet with stretchable elastic all around to ensure it fits securely, preventing slipping and shifting and keep tightly smooth (the fitted sheet fits mattresses snugly up to 13” in height) perfect choice if you are using memory foam mattress toppers or pads! ✔️SUPER QUALITY AT GREAT VALUE: Super soft for being so budget friendly, affordable Jersey Knit Sheets, Feels like your favorite T-Shirt. , affordable 100 Percent Modal Sheets, Modal gives it an extra luxurious finish such finish which you can’t even see with sheets costing double of it. Our perfect bed sheets are lightweight and cool in the summer and Cozy and warmer for chilly winter nights, COLORS AVAILABLE: White, Papyrus, Parchment, Blue Haze, Ash Grey & Fossil and Rose. ✔️HIGHEST QUALITY FABRIC: With 150GSM for lasting durability. Hotel-quality bedding is woven from the highest quality modal for ultimate softness and comfort. Fully elasticized fitted sheet. Deep pocketed, extremely soft and comfortable. 100% Modal Jersey Bed Sheet Set. Breathable which provide you maximum sleep comfort. Modal from lenzing fiber. Modal is a semi-synthetic cellulose fiber. Modal Fabric is made by spinning cellulose that has been reconstituted from beech tree. OEKO CERTIFIED. ✔️EASY CARE: Our high quality Modal sheets have a 100% satisfaction guarantee. Machine washable and dry-able bed sheet set. Wash in cold water with similar colors, tumble dry on low. For best use, wash separately on first use. Designed with such standards which can outperform all sheet sets in its comparison, also won't shrink and fade after washing. No extra Ironing or Expensive cleaning materials required. Always follow care label instructions for best results","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ohaBb23mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Briarwood Home","source_asin":"B08D38VQF5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D38VQF5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D38VQF5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":658974,"name":"Kuhn Rikon 5-Inch Nonstick Colori Santoku Knife, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M7B0PaJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a stylish touch to your kitchen with the colorful, award-winning Swiss design of this unique 5-inch Santoku knife in red from Kuhn Rikon. More than just a kitchen decoration, this highly functional 5-inch Santoku knife is styled after the classic Japanese cook's knife with a broad blade and especially sharp cutting edge. It's perfect for precision cutting and a great companion for mincing, slicing, and dicing a variety of ingredients. Rib and indents on knife--as well as nonstick coating--keep food from clinging to blade. It's made from solid, super-sharp Japanese steel and features an ergonomic handle for better control of your slicing. A great choice for bringing along to picnics or weekends away, it includes a protective plastic sheath for storage and safety while traveling. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M7B0PaJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUHN RIKON","source_asin":"B0028RXHOE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0028RXHOE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0028RXHOE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":658975,"name":"12\" Microwave Plate Replacement, Compatible with Whirlpool Glass Turntable Tray, Equivalent to W10337247, W11367904，W11291538","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q6bvTJbYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Tempreature Glass 1. Durable & Premium Quality Material : Our microwave oven glass plate made of strong glass, and heat-resistant (without BPA glass) ，Sturdy and durable, making your microwave work better . The plate replacement parts are thick, dishwasher safe, heat-resistant and food-safe, designed to extend the life of your microwave oven. 2. Perfect Size : Diameter of whirlpool microwave glass plate is 12inch(305mm), Outside turnable track diameter where wheels fit is 9 5/16 inches (236mm). Inside track dimeter is 7 1/2 inches(190mm) . In order to avoid to purchase the wrong part, please measure the microwave interior to ensure that it fit 12 inches plate before ordering. 3. 12\" Microwave Glass Turntable ：We provide 12\"/30.5cm microwave glass plate that fits most small microwave ovens. Applicable to microwave ovens and ovens of multiple brands and models, only the diameter and bottom shape need to be confirmed ..It fits Whirlpool, Amana and other brands microwave. Such as AMV1150VAD3, AMV2174VAD6, GMH6185XVB3, IMH15XVQ4, MMV1164WW4, WMH1163XVB5, WMH2175XVB5, WMH31017AB0, WMH31017AD1, WMH31017AS0 and more. 4. How To Ensuring Proper Fit : 1) Check your bushing coupler (centerpiece that turns the microwave plate) & ensure it has three notches - these should align with the middle of plate. 2) Measure the microwave interior to ensure a 12\" diameter microwave turntable Tray fits . Easy to install, No tool required; it takes no time to replace the part ,very convenient 5. Easy to clean ：The microwave turntable is easy to clean and can be cleaned with cloth, paper towels, soap or dishwasher. The glass turntable collects oil/water droplets/food that leaks during cooking. Save energy and time. making it a great choice when you're replacing an old microwave glass plate. Effectively help you save time and money","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q6bvTJbYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aokansha","source_asin":"B09KG9T2L1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KG9T2L1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KG9T2L1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":658976,"name":"Now Designs Ecologie Condiment Bowls, Spice, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NKPzOP-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Now Designs is pleased to offer Ecologie: an innovative line of environmentally sustainable dinnerware and serveware. All items in the Ecologie line are made from a plastic-like material made of crushed bamboo and rice husks. It is tested food-safe and contains no harmful chemicals. Despite being durable for everyday household use, Ecologie items will naturally biodegrade in a landfill, for complete cradle to grave sustainability. Ecologie dinnerware items are lightweight with a smooth matte finish and are perfect for summer outdoor dining or everyday indoor use. All Ecologie items are top rack dishwasher safe. Not intended for use in the microwave. This condiment set includes four coordinating condiment bowls, each measuring 4 by 4 Inch square. With a 7 ounce capacity, these bowls are perfect for sauces, toppings and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NKPzOP-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B00IP45OPO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-658976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IP45OPO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IP45OPO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
